935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0e6c8c75d056b765\" href=\"?note=0e6c8c75d056b765\" title=\"67-df-compositional-partial-truth\">67-df-compositional-partial-truth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 2(a)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"64"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"75"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"Theorem 5.2(a) 陈述及 Lemmas 1–3 依赖结构已核对；完整自指构造未独立形式验证"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是一致原始递归公理集；采用本册固定证明算术化、PR 层级及部分真接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma,\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d})\">\\((\\Gamma,\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d})\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n)\">\\((\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n)\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Pi_n,\\Sigma_n)\">\\((\\Pi_n,\\Sigma_n)\\)</span>。两类取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5d04e3c8a5885c18\" href=\"?note=5d04e3c8a5885c18\" title=\"67-df-partially-conservative\">67-df-partially-conservative</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d}\">\\(\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d}\\)</span> 表示同层对偶类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的固定编号为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>。每个出现的有效理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 绑定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_A\">\\(E_A\\)</span>；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\">\\(\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>部分真参数取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0e6c8c75d056b765\" href=\"?note=0e6c8c75d056b765\" title=\"67-df-compositional-partial-truth\">67-df-compositional-partial-truth</a> 的同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,c,r,b\">\\(U,c,r,b\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPT}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{CPT}(U)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)\\)</span>；所有公式类使用该接口的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\gamma\">\\(D,\\gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\bigl(T\\nvdash\\varphi\\land\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma(\\varphi,T)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\bigl(T\\nvdash\\varphi\\land\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma(\\varphi,T)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>恢复原书 Theorem 5.2(a) 的非平凡存在结论，替换旧稿仅消去定义的重述。不能以任取一个已在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中可证的句子充当该见证。</p>\n<p>原书通过有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 后果的部分真近似、Lemma 2–3 与自指构造证明存在性。陈述、对偶复杂度及不可证条件已核对；本次没有独立完成这些内部算术化构造的全部验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-partially-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"5d04e3c8a5885c18","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-partially-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resol